      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Neutral to Moderately Bullish\' outlook is most probable. The strategic rationale and performance-aligned deal structure provide a strong foundation. However, the current macroeconomic environment and inherent integration risks temper the immediate bullish potential. A successful integration and consistent performance from QC Capital could gradually shift the outlook towards more robust bullishness over the 2-3 year horizon.",
