      neutralCase: "The Indian government will likely continue its cautious approach, focusing on developing a balanced regulatory framework that aims to mitigate risks without stifling innovation entirely. This \'wait and watch\' strategy, while slow, could eventually lead to a more stable and secure environment for digital assets, albeit with a slower pace of adoption than some market participants might desire.",
