      keyRisks: ["Protracted period of net outflows from spot Bitcoin ETFs.", "Unexpected tightening of monetary policy or exacerbation of inflation.", "Large-scale regulatory action targeting crypto exchanges or stablecoins.", "Intensification of geopolitical conflicts impacting global markets.", "Exploits or security breaches affecting major crypto platforms."],
