      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A neutral-to-cautiously-bearish outlook appears most probable in the short term. The confluence of a critical technical test, dollar strength, and analyst warnings about further downside suggests a higher probability of consolidation or a deeper retest of support levels before a sustained rally. However, strong institutional foundations and historical precedent for the 200-week SMA prevent a decisively bearish long-term view.",
