      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Neutral to Moderately Bullish\' outlook, with an estimated 55% chance of gradual improvement in security and regulatory clarity, leading to sustained growth. There\'s a 30% chance of continued high-impact security incidents and slow regulatory progress, and a 15% chance of rapid, industry-wide adoption of robust security and inheritance solutions.",
      potentialCatalysts: ["Development of industry-standard security protocols and audits.", "Clear legislative action on digital asset inheritance in major economies.", "Successful recovery of significant stolen funds from major hacks.", "Increased adoption of hardware wallets and secure self-custody solutions.", "Innovation in decentralized identity and secure key management."],
