      tokenUtility: "Bitcoin primarily serves as a store of value, often referred to as \'digital gold,\' due to its scarcity and censorship resistance. It is also used as a medium of exchange for transactions, though its volatility can limit this function. Its decentralized nature allows for permissionless transfers across borders.",
