    opportunities: ["Long-term adoption of blockchain technology and cryptocurrencies.", "Development of clear and supportive regulatory frameworks.", "Successful monetization of emerging crypto use cases.", "Potential for Bitcoin to act as a hedge against fiat currency devaluation in specific scenarios.", "Innovation in DeFi and Web3 leading to new financial paradigms."],
    outlook: "The immediate outlook for Bitcoin and the broader crypto market remains highly sensitive to global macroeconomic developments, particularly the Federal Reserve\'s monetary policy. While innovation within the crypto space continues, the ability to translate this into sustained, profitable growth will be critical. Regulatory clarity, or the lack thereof, will also play a significant role in shaping investor confidence and market direction. A cautious stance is warranted until there is greater certainty regarding interest rates and regulatory frameworks.",
