    featuredImagePrompt: "A highly conceptual, abstract visual representing Anthropic\'s unique mission-driven IPO. Imagine a stylized, glowing path ascending towards a distant, ethereal city, symbolizing future potential and a \'noble mission.\' The path should be composed of interwoven digital data streams and subtle, glowing neural network patterns. In the foreground, a subtle, almost spiritual \'book\' or scroll made of light, with faint text, signifies the S-1 filing\'s \'good book\' analogy. The color palette should be deep blues, purples, and electric greens, with hints of gold, conveying innovation, ambition, and ethical AI. No human figures or specific company logos, focus on the abstract concept of an AI company\'s unique journey to public markets, balancing high costs with a grand vision.",
