      tradingVolume: "Trading volume for BNB and other assets on Binance could see erratic movements. Initial panic selling might lead to high volume, followed by a potential drop if users exit the platform, or a surge if recovery efforts instill confidence. The phased withdrawal resumption for Bitcoin might temporarily suppress volume for other assets.",
      priceMovement: "BNB\'s price is highly susceptible to negative sentiment from the hack. Expect significant downward pressure and increased volatility in the short to medium term as the market assesses the damage and Binance\'s recovery plan. Bitcoin and other major cryptocurrencies may also experience a dip due to contagion fears, though potentially less severe than BNB.",
      onChainMetrics: "On-chain metrics for BNB Chain could show increased activity related to asset transfers off the Binance exchange, indicating users moving funds to self-custody or other platforms. Transaction volumes and active addresses might fluctuate, reflecting user reactions to the security incident.",
      whaleActivity: "Whale wallets associated with BNB and other assets on Binance might show increased outflows as large holders de-risk. Significant selling by whales could exacerbate price declines, while accumulation during a dip could signal long-term confidence if the recovery is perceived positively.",
