      regulatoryDevelopments: "This incident is a massive regulatory flashpoint. Expect immediate and intense scrutiny from financial regulators globally, including potential investigations, demands for stricter compliance, enhanced reporting requirements, and possibly new regulations specific to cybersecurity for crypto exchanges. This could shape the future regulatory landscape for digital assets.",
