    outlook: "The outlook for the cryptocurrency market is one of continued dynamic evolution. Regulatory clarity, particularly for stablecoins and privacy-enhancing tools, will be a dominant theme. We anticipate increased pressure on projects that challenge regulatory norms, but also a parallel drive for innovation that seeks to comply while preserving core crypto principles. Proactive measures against quantum threats will likely accelerate, reinforcing the long-term viability of major assets like Bitcoin. Critically, the market is expected to mature in its approach to operational risks, with a stronger emphasis on robust, transparent, and regulated custodial solutions, potentially leading to a consolidation among exchanges. Investors will increasingly favor assets and platforms demonstrating strong security, regulatory compliance, and transparent operations.",
